sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant A as API
 participant D as Database
 participant W as Worker
 U->>A: Authorized bounded file upload
 A->>A: Validate bytes and compute SHA-256
 A->>D: Version plus queued job
 A-->>U: 202 job ID
 W->>D: Claim lease and fencing token
 W->>W: Verify parse chunk embed
 W->>D: Commit chunks and switch active generation
 W->>D: Mark ready and save timings
